            "image_loading": "lazy",
            "logo": "",
            "pretitle": "",
            "title_tag": "h2",
            "title": "L-Class Dust Extraction",
            "subtitle_tag": "h1",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>The Vacmaster WD L20 has been independently certified for the safe extraction of light hazardous dusts with a workplace exposure limit (WEL) value of &gt; 1 mg/m3. L Class Dust Extractors should be used when collecting materials such as; soft woods, gypsum, plasterboard and Corian. They are our recommended Industrial Wet and Dry Vacuum Cleaner for workshop, trade and manufacturing settings.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "black",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
            "button_2_style": "transparent-black",
            "button_2_text": "",
            "button_2_url": ""
          }
        },
        "text_with_image_8krqyC": {
          "type": "text-with-image",
          "settings": {
            "align_content": "",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Vacmaster_wet_vac_long_reach_VK1620SWC.webp",
            "image_loading": "lazy",
            "logo": "",
            "pretitle": "",
            "title_tag": "h2",
            "title": "Long Reach",
            "subtitle_tag": "h1",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>With a working reach of approx. 9.5m, the WD L20 wet and dry vacuum cleaner features a 3.5m crush resistant screw fit suction hose and a toughened 5m PVC power cable.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "black",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
            "button_2_style": "white",
            "button_2_text": "",
            "button_2_url": ""
          }
        },
        "text_with_image_n4Te6J": {
          "type": "text-with-image",
          "settings": {
            "align_content": "",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Dust_Extractor_Wet_vacuuming_Vacmaster.webp",
            "image_loading": "",
            "logo": "",
            "pretitle": "",
            "title_tag": "h1",
            "title": "Wet or Dry Extraction",
            "subtitle_tag": "h1",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>Vacuum either wet or dry debris. Fit the HEPA cartridge filter and optional dust bag to capture dry debris. Switch to the foam filter to extract liquids.</p>",
